---
import AuthorContact from "./AuthorContact.astro";
---

<div class="flex flex-col space-y-12">
  <div>
    <h1 class="font-mono text-muted text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">
      &gt;_author_profile
    </h1>
    <div
      class="font-body text-[24px] leading-relaxed text-text-main font-normal space-y-8"
    >
      <p>
        Senior systems engineer and technical writer focusing on <span
          class="text-primary font-medium">distributed systems</span
        >, <span class="text-primary font-medium">Rust</span>, and
        infrastructure architecture.
      </p>
      <p>
        Currently building resilient data pipelines at a global fintech
        organization. Previously spent 6 years architecting high-throughput
        microservices and untangling legacy monoliths.
      </p>
      <p>
        This ledger serves as a public notebook for complex engineering
        challenges, post-mortems, and architectural deep-dives.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <AuthorContact />
</div>
